<title>USA: Comdisco Inc sells $250 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Comdisco Inc sells $250 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Comdisco Inc was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Comdisco buys, sells, leases new and used IBM equipment. They also arrange leases on other computer, hi-tech equipment, and provides disaster recovery backup for computer users.</p>
<p>BORROWER COMDISCO INC</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.50 PCT   MATURITY 4/30/1999</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.808  FIRST PAY DATE 10/30/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 6.606 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD +35 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
